"B<max31855>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<temp-kelvin\\&.>I<M> float out (M=0\\&.\\&."
"( personality & 0xf ))"
msgstr ""
"B<max31855>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<temp-kelvin\\&.>I<M> float out (M=0\\&.\\&."
"( особистість & 0xf ))"

