"B<moveoff>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<waypoint-sample-secs> float in (default: I<0\\&.02>)"
msgstr ""
"B<moveoff>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<waypoint-sample-secs> float in (за замовчуванням: "
"I<0\\&.02>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/moveoff.9:113
