"B<moveoff>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<fb-minusoffset->I<M> float out (M=0\\&."
"\\&.personality)"
msgstr ""
"B<moveoff>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<fb-minusoffset->I<M> float out (M=0\\&."
