"After tripping home switch, travel in opposite direction is required (amount "
"set by the hysteresis pin)\\&. A pin (index-enable) is provided for use when "
"B<[JOINT_n]HOME_USE_INDEX> is specified to reset the I/O pin "
"B<joint\\&.N\\&.index-enable>\\&."
msgstr ""
