"B<loadrt tristate_float> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]]"
msgstr ""
"B<loadrt tristate_float> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/tristate_float.9:38
